@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@parcelId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### Overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forge/current-use/parcels/{{parcelId}}/overview

### Evidence
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forge/current-use/parcels/{{parcelId}}/evidence

### Timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forge/current-use/parcels/{{parcelId}}/timeline

### Rollback calculation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/forge/current-use/rollback/calculate
